    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Containing information to case, patient, procedures, diagnoses, comorbidities, microbiology, lab values, vitals, SOFA, MEWS score. The INFRA dataset conforms to the OMOP CDM v5.4 standard and can be exported through various means, such as OHDSI tools, R packages or as an CSV export. For the existing SPHN Concepts, the dataset can also be exported as a knowledge graph (.TTL) compliant to the SPHN RDF Schema."
      }
    ],
